{"data":[{"conversation_id":"1842091649507459281","created_at":"2024-10-04T06:37:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1842091649507459281"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"vpsdawanjia.com/8567.html","end":190,"expanded_url":"https://www.vpsdawanjia.com/8567.html","start":167,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://www.vpsdawanjia.com/8567.html","url":"https://t.co/glgMlRlRIf"}]},"id":"1842091649507459281","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":72,"impression_count":10679,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":15},"text":"注册美国公司的朋友不要忘了申报 BOI 📝\n\n申报 BOI (Beneficial Ownership Information) 企业受益所有人信息，主要目的是为了打击金融犯罪 🚫\n\n- 2024年1月1号后成立的公司在90天内申报 \n\n- 2025年1月1号后成立的公司在30天内申报 \n\n按照这个流程，半个小时就可以搞定 ⏳  \nhttps://t.co/glgMlRlRIf"},{"conversation_id":"1839522775670940055","created_at":"2024-09-27T04:29:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1839522784520884582"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"Tweeteasy.io","end":102,"expanded_url":"http://Tweeteasy.io","start":79,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://tweeteasy.io/","url":"https://t.co/yjVlj095ap"}]},"id":"1839522784520884582","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":2153,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"虽然我也没有赚到多少钱，但如果真心出海早晚要走向正规。所以还不如早点熟悉流程，后面把更多精力投入到产品上。\n\n如果你也正在做英文推，可以试试我开发的推特工具 https://t.co/yjVlj095ap\n\n最后祝大家都能一次通过，出海顺利 ⛵"},{"conversation_id":"1839522775670940055","created_at":"2024-09-27T04:29:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1839522782620922151"],"id":"1839522782620922151","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2249,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"3. 公司网站和个人 Profile 地址，这两项也是非必填的。\n\n我觉得坑就是这些非必填选项。你可以不填，他也可以让你不过。\n\n填海外社交媒体的主页就可以，这里我填的是推特英文账号的 profile 地址。"},{"conversation_id":"1839522775670940055","created_at":"2024-09-27T04:29:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1839522780527644874"],"id":"1839522780527644874","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2527,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2. 公司产品网站。这个虽然是非必填，但它会影响你的成功机率。\n\n审核过程中，要求我补交域名的证明文件。我的域名在 Cloudflare 注册的，所以把后台截图发了上去。\n\n域名联系人的姓名、电话、邮箱、地址最好和你注册银行填的保持一致。这些信息在 Cloudflare 是可以修改的。"},{"conversation_id":"1839522775670940055","created_at":"2024-09-27T04:29:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1839522778245902688"],"id":"1839522778245902688","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2582,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"1. 公司地址。我填的是驾照上的地址，地址证明提交了驾驶证的翻译件。\n\n后面在审核的过程，再次让我提交地址证明（信用卡账单、身份证之类的），我提交的是身份证的翻译件。\n\n驾驶证和身份证地址需要一致，翻译件都可以在网上办理。我使用的是租租车和跑政通小程序。"}],"meta":{"newest_id":"1842091649507459281","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btw4b157lht3elp7uf22gymw03hhph4","oldest_id":"1839522778245902688","result_count":5}}